@startuml
title Circuit breaker around a dependency

hide empty description

state "CLOSED\ncalls pass and are counted" as CLOSED #C8E6C9
state "OPEN\ncalls are refused at once" as OPEN #FFCDD2
state "HALF-OPEN\nthree trial calls pass" as HALF #FFF8E1

[*] --> CLOSED
CLOSED --> OPEN : failures or slow calls\nreach the threshold
OPEN --> HALF : the waiting time has passed
HALF --> CLOSED : the three trial calls succeed
HALF --> OPEN : one trial call fails
@enduml
